--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This distribution bundles no third-party source. Dependencies are resolved
at build time and retain their own licenses:

  - Go module dependencies: see backend/go.sum and capability/go.sum;
    resolve with `go mod download` and inspect with
    `go list -m -json all`.
  - Node dependencies: see frontend/pnpm-lock.yaml.
  - Container base images: pinned by digest in backend/deploy/Dockerfile
    and frontend/deploy/Dockerfile.

Every direct dependency is under a permissive licence (Apache-2.0, MIT,
BSD-3-Clause or BSD-2-Clause). Adding a dependency under a copyleft or
source-available licence requires an ADR — see docs/adr/.
